# Research layout

Live topic folder: `docs/research/<topic-slug>/` holds the note, runners, and companion CSV/HTML.

Archive: move the whole folder to `docs/archive/<topic-slug>/`. Companions travel with it.

`data/archive/` is season ingest (`YYYY-YY`) only. `data/reports/` is solver/tool output.

Index and conventions: `docs/research/INDEX.md`. Layout test: `tests/test_research_layout.py`.
